#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:162 2fd9bbd6990f4eaa861a8aa693864daa
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search PubMed biomedical literature database using NCBI "
"E-utilities (esearch + esummary). Returns articles with PMID, title, "
"authors, journal, publication year, DOI, article type, and PubMed URL. "
"Automatically fetches rich metadata for each article. Use this to "
"discover medical/life sciences literature, find articles by topic, or "
"search for publications by author or journal. Rate limiting is "
"automatically handled (3 req/sec without API key, 10 req/sec with key set"
" via NCBI\\_API\\_KEY environment variable)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:166 c2439e71826a4110b6d3b35efab2c609
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for PubMed articles. Use "
"keywords, author names, journal names, or MeSH terms. Examples: 'cancer "
"immunotherapy', 'Smith J[Author]', 'Nature[Journal]', 'diabetes[MeSH]'. "
"Use AND/OR/NOT for complex queries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:169 631932319a31434499823d0ed8813ca9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Number of articles to return. This sets "
"the maximum number of articles retrieved from PubMed (max: 200)."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选） 返回的文章数量。此参数设置从PubMed检索的最大文章数。"

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:172 c9aaf384f8c6446395fbd6237a122a8d
msgid ""
"``mindate`` (string) (optional) Minimum date for results (format: "
"YYYY/MM/DD or YYYY). Requires datetype to be set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:175 e7aaf14c5d794b4993a2750671e0b944
msgid ""
"``maxdate`` (string) (optional) Maximum date for results (format: "
"YYYY/MM/DD or YYYY). Requires datetype to be set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:178 cb899f841a6a4e14a01ab687f35527cc
msgid ""
"``datetype`` (string) (optional) Type of date to filter on: 'pdat' "
"(publication date), 'edat' (Entrez date), or 'mdat' (modification date). "
"Required when using mindate/maxdate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:181 a1ca56b054754b15a66f8f21af0cf987
msgid ""
"``include_abstract`` (boolean) (optional) If true, best-effort fetches "
"abstracts via efetch (adds abstract/abstract\\_source fields)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:184 834359a1d2444b45957994a5b2a37214
msgid ""
"``sort`` (string) (optional) Sort order for results. Valid values: "
"'pub\\_date' (newest first), 'Author' (alphabetical by first author), "
"'JournalName' (alphabetical by journal), 'relevance' (default PubMed "
"ranking)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pubmed_tools.rst:187 39ab2ea573014ffd9af9c8245c989b48
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Alias for limit — maximum number of "
"results to return"
msgstr ""

